1
00:00:00,055 --> 00:00:01,935
(Leonard:)Why are you reading
Pride and Prejudice?

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:03,160
(Sheldon:)I'll tell you why.

3
00:00:03,725 --> 00:00:06,435
(Sheldon:)Amy ruined
Raiders of the Lost Ark for me,

4
00:00:06,661 --> 00:00:10,471
(Sheldon:)so now I'm trying to find something
beloved to her and ruin that.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,770
(Howard:)Because her life wasn't enough?

6
00:00:17,005 --> 00:00:21,245
Wait. How can anyone ruin
Raiders? It's perfect.

7
00:00:21,343 --> 00:00:22,653
(Sheldon:)Yeah, except for the fact

8
00:00:22,811 --> 00:00:25,351
(Sheldon:)that Indiana Jones is completely
irrelevant to the story.

9
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:29,290
(Sheldon:)With or without him, the Nazis find
the ark, open it, and die.

10
00:00:34,422 --> 00:00:37,262
(GRUMBLING)

11
00:00:37,859 --> 00:00:41,599
(Howard:)Hey, wait a minute. No, the Nazis
were digging in the wrong place.

12
00:00:41,763 --> 00:00:44,213
(Howard:)The only reason they got the ark
was because Indy found it first.

13
00:00:44,366 --> 00:00:45,966
(Leonard:)Actually, they were only digging
in the wrong place

14
00:00:46,134 --> 00:00:47,304
(Leonard:)because Indy had the medallion.

15
00:00:47,469 --> 00:00:51,009
(Leonard:)Without him, they would have had
the medallion and dug in the right place.

16
00:00:53,141 --> 00:01:00,021
(GRUMBLING)

